# Runaway background job (k6/cpuhog.js, 8 VUs; POST /chaos/cpuhog at t = 4 min)

23 runs from `evaluation_results_cpuhog.csv`. Blind test: designed after prompt v4 was frozen. Looks like CPU overload (CPU ~0.9, throttling ~18%) at a third of the capacity rps; only a restart fixes it. **The server-side p95 rows are not meaningful here**: the app's histogram does not time requests queued behind a blocked event loop, so once the hogged pods get few requests the server p95 looks healthy while users wait. Judge by "Fault gone after" and the k6 rows.

